        <div class="tool-icon">✍️</div>
        <h3>AI SEO Description Generator</h3>
        <p>Type just your topic — get a complete SEO-optimized description with hook, chapters, hashtags and tags.</p>
        <span class="tool-go">Open tool &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="tool-card" href="/tools/ai-title-generator">
        <div class="tool-icon">📝</div>
        <h3>AI Video Title Generator</h3>
        <p>16 clickable, curiosity-driven title ideas in proven viral formats.</p>
        <span class="tool-go">Open tool &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="tool-card" href="/tools/keyword-suggestion">
        <span class="badge-hot">HOT</span>
        <div class="tool-icon">🔑</div>
        <h3>Keyword Suggestion</h3>
        <p>Live YouTube autocomplete data — real searches viewers are typing right now.</p>
        <span class="tool-go">Open tool &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="tool-card" href="/tools/ai-tags-generator">
        <div class="tool-icon">🏷️</div>
        <h3>AI Tags Generator</h3>
        <p>Optimized tags auto-fitted to YouTube's 500-character limit.</p>
        <span class="tool-go">Open tool &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="tool-card" href="/tools/thumbnail-downloader">
        <div class="tool-icon">🖼️</div>
        <h3>Thumbnail Downloader</h3>
        <p>Download any YouTube thumbnail in full HD for research.</p>
        <span class="tool-go">Open tool &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="tool-card" href="/tools/trending-videos">
        <span class="badge-hot">HOT</span>
        <div class="tool-icon">🔥</div>
        <h3>Trending Topic Finder</h3>
        <p>Discover what viewers are searching for right now in your niche.</p>
        <span class="tool-go">Open tool &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center" style="margin-top:8px">
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/tools">View all 14 tools &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">How Our Calculator Works</h2>
    <p>The math is the same simple formula creators use to sanity-check their YouTube Studio analytics:</p>
    <p><code>(Views &divide; 1,000) &times; RPM = estimated earnings</code></p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Enter your monthly views</strong> &mdash; use your average from YouTube Studio for the most realistic result.</li>
      <li><strong>Set your RPM</strong> &mdash; check your actual RPM in YouTube Studio, or pick your audience&rsquo;s country for a typical range.</li>
      <li><strong>Get instant breakdowns</strong> &mdash; monthly, weekly, daily and yearly estimates, right on the page.</li>
    </ol>
    <div class="disclaimer-box">
      <strong>Estimates only.</strong> Every result is a ballpark figure for planning and education &mdash; not a promise of income. Real revenue depends on monetized views (not all views earn), your niche, audience country, watch time and season.
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('../partials/faq', { faqs: homeFaqs }) %>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
